WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.432
First Normal Form removes repeating groups and
requires each field to represent

00:00:04.458 --> 00:00:10.043
one value Instead of storing several service codes
in one cell each

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:15.809
appointment-service occurrence gets its own row That
immediately makes each service

00:00:15.835 --> 00:00:21.982
easier to filter validate and connect to other
tables But 1NF

00:00:22.009 --> 00:00:27.740
does not solve every design problem In the example
patient information

00:00:27.898 --> 00:00:33.371
provider information appointment information and
service information are still repeated across
several

00:00:33.398 --> 00:00:39.104
rows So think of 1NF as the beginning of the
normalization

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:43.751
process We have removed lists inside fields but we
still need to

00:00:43.764 --> 00:00:46.449
ask which columns depend on which parts of the key
